 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official Google Cloud Memorystore for Redis API (v1) discovery document. Every other official method returns HTTP 501 UNIMPLEMENTED. Instances and clusters are configuration metadata: no Redis node, endpoint, AUTH string, certificate or cached data exists, and they report READY or ACTIVE immediately; getAuthString, import, export, failover and upgrade remain unimplemented. Backup restores, cross-cluster replication, ACL policies, customer-managed CA pools, maintenance triggers and tag bindings are refused. Deletion protection blocks cluster delete. Long-running operations complete synchronously.",
  "title": "Memorystore for Redis (simulator catalog)",
  "version": "v1"
 },
